{"seq":3,"slug":"proguard-and-r8","title":"ProGuard 与 R8","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/proguard-and-r8","wordCount":748,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"proguard-与-r8\">ProGuard 与 R8</h1><p>R8 是 Android 默认的代码优化工具，取代了 ProGuard。它在编译时执行代码压缩、混淆和优化，显著减小 APK 体积并提高运行时性能。R8 完全兼容 ProGuard 的规则语法。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>R8 围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三个阶段</strong>：压缩（Shrinking，移除未引用代码与资源）、混淆（Obfuscation，重命名为短名称并增加逆向难度）、优化（Optimization，内联、常量传播、死代码消除、类合并）。</li>\n<li><strong>开关与依赖</strong>：<code>isMinifyEnabled</code> 控制压缩与混淆，<code>isShrinkResources</code> 只有在前者开启时才生效。</li>\n<li><strong>Keep 规则</strong>：告诉 R8 哪些代码不能被动，是正确配置的核心；反射、序列化、API 接口、枚举、Parcelable 等需特别关注。</li>\n<li><strong>可调试性</strong>：<code>mapping.txt</code> 记录原始名与混淆名的映射，是反混淆线上崩溃堆栈的关键文件，必须随版本保存并上传到崩溃平台。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"代码压缩-shrinking\">代码压缩（Shrinking）</h2><p>代码压缩移除未使用的类、方法和字段，减少最终 APK 的体积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"android {&#10;    buildTypes {&#10;        release {&#10;            isMinifyEnabled = true&#10;            isShrinkResources = true&#10;            proguardFiles(&#10;                getDefaultProguardFile(&quot;proguard-android-optimize.txt&quot;),&#10;                &quot;proguard-rules.pro&quot;&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buildTypes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        release {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isMinifyEnabled = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isShrinkResources = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            proguardFiles(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                getDefaultProguardFile(\"proguard-android-optimize.txt\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"proguard-rules.pro\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[完整代码] --&gt; B[R8 分析]&#10;    B --&gt; C{代码是否被引用?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[保留]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[移除 Tree Shaking]&#10;    D --&gt; F[混淆]&#10;    F --&gt; G[优化]&#10;    G --&gt; H[输出 DEX]&#10;    E --&gt; I[丢弃]&#10;&#10;    classDef processStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B,F,G processStyle\">graph TD\n    A[完整代码] --&gt; B[R8 分析]\n    B --&gt; C{代码是否被引用?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[保留]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[移除 Tree Shaking]\n    D --&gt; F[混淆]\n    F --&gt; G[优化]\n    G --&gt; H[输出 DEX]\n    E --&gt; I[丢弃]\n\n    classDef processStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B,F,G processStyle</pre><p>R8 执行的三个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>压缩（Shrinking）</td>\n<td>移除未使用的代码和资源</td>\n<td>减小体积 30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混淆（Obfuscation）</td>\n<td>重命名类/方法为短名称</td>\n<td>减小体积 + 增加逆向难度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化（Optimization）</td>\n<td>内联方法、简化控制流</td>\n<td>提升运行时性能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>isShrinkResources = true</code> 只有在 <code>isMinifyEnabled = true</code> 时才生效，它会移除未被代码引用的资源文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"混淆-obfuscation\">混淆（Obfuscation）</h2><p>混淆将类名、方法名替换为无意义的短名称，增加反编译难度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 混淆前&#10;com.example.myapp.data.repository.ArticleRepository&#10;com.example.myapp.data.repository.ArticleRepository.getArticles()&#10;com.example.myapp.data.model.Article&#10;&#10;# 混淆后&#10;a.b.c.d&#10;a.b.c.d.a()&#10;a.b.c.e\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 混淆前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>com.example.myapp.data.repository.ArticleRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>com.example.myapp.data.repository.ArticleRepository.getArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>com.example.myapp.data.model.Article</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 混淆后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>a.b.c.d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>a.b.c.d.a()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>a.b.c.e</span></span></code></pre></div><p>混淆映射文件（<code>mapping.txt</code>）记录了原始名称和混淆名称的对应关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"com.example.myapp.data.repository.ArticleRepository -&gt; a.b.c.d:&#10;    java.util.List getArticles() -&gt; a&#10;    void deleteArticle(java.lang.String) -&gt; b&#10;com.example.myapp.data.model.Article -&gt; a.b.c.e:&#10;    java.lang.String id -&gt; a&#10;    java.lang.String title -&gt; b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>com.example.myapp.data.repository.ArticleRepository -> a.b.c.d:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    java.util.List getArticles() -> a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    void deleteArticle(java.lang.String) -> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>com.example.myapp.data.model.Article -> a.b.c.e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    java.lang.String id -> a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    java.lang.String title -> b</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优化-optimization\">优化（Optimization）</h2><p><code>proguard-android-optimize.txt</code> 启用额外的优化选项。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 优化会执行以下操作&#10;// 1. 方法内联 - 将小方法的代码直接嵌入调用处&#10;// 2. 常量传播 - 将常量值直接替换到使用处&#10;// 3. 死代码消除 - 移除不可达代码&#10;// 4. 类合并 - 将只有一个实现的接口与实现类合并&#10;&#10;// R8 全模式（更激进的优化）&#10;android {&#10;    buildTypes {&#10;        release {&#10;            proguardFiles(&#10;                getDefaultProguardFile(&quot;proguard-android-optimize.txt&quot;),&#10;                &quot;proguard-rules.pro&quot;&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// gradle.properties&#10;// android.enableR8.fullMode=true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 优化会执行以下操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 方法内联 - 将小方法的代码直接嵌入调用处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 常量传播 - 将常量值直接替换到使用处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 死代码消除 - 移除不可达代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 4. 类合并 - 将只有一个实现的接口与实现类合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// R8 全模式（更激进的优化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buildTypes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        release {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            proguardFiles(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                getDefaultProguardFile(\"proguard-android-optimize.txt\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"proguard-rules.pro\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// gradle.properties</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// android.enableR8.fullMode=true</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"keep-规则\">Keep 规则</h2><p>Keep 规则告诉 R8 哪些代码不能被压缩或混淆，是正确配置 R8 的核心。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"proguard\" data-code=\"# 保留所有 Serializable 类的序列化字段&#10;-keepclassmembers class * implements java.io.Serializable {&#10;    static final long serialVersionUID;&#10;    private static final java.io.ObjectStreamField[] serialPersistentFields;&#10;    !static !transient &lt;fields&gt;;&#10;    private void writeObject(java.io.ObjectOutputStream);&#10;    private void readObject(java.io.ObjectInputStream);&#10;    java.lang.Object writeReplace();&#10;    java.lang.Object readResolve();&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Kotlin Serialization&#10;-keepattributes *Annotation*, InnerClasses&#10;-dontnote kotlinx.serialization.AnnotationsKt&#10;&#10;-keepclassmembers @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class ** {&#10;    *** Companion;&#10;}&#10;-if @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class **&#10;-keepclassmembers class &lt;1&gt;$Companion {&#10;    kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...);&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Retrofit API 接口&#10;-keep,allowobfuscation interface * {&#10;    @retrofit2.http.* &lt;methods&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Room Entity&#10;-keep @androidx.room.Entity class * { *; }&#10;&#10;# 枚举类&#10;-keepclassmembers enum * {&#10;    public static **[] values();&#10;    public static ** valueOf(java.lang.String);&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 自定义 Parcelable&#10;-keep class * implements android.os.Parcelable {&#10;    public static final android.os.Parcelable$Creator *;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 保留所有 Serializable 类的序列化字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keepclassmembers class * implements java.io.Serializable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    static final long serialVersionUID;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static final java.io.ObjectStreamField[] serialPersistentFields;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    !static !transient &#x3C;fields>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void writeObject(java.io.ObjectOutputStream);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void readObject(java.io.ObjectInputStream);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    java.lang.Object writeReplace();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    java.lang.Object readResolve();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Kotlin Serialization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keepattributes *Annotation*, InnerClasses</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-dontnote kotlinx.serialization.AnnotationsKt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keepclassmembers @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class ** {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    *** Companion;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-if @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class **</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keepclassmembers class &#x3C;1>$Companion {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Retrofit API 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keep,allowobfuscation interface * {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @retrofit2.http.* &#x3C;methods>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Room Entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keep @androidx.room.Entity class * { *; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 枚举类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keepclassmembers enum * {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static **[] values();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static ** valueOf(java.lang.String);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 自定义 Parcelable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-keep class * implements android.os.Parcelable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static final android.os.Parcelable$Creator *;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用 Keep 变体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>防止压缩</th>\n<th>防止混淆</th>\n<th>防止优化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-keep</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-keepnames</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-keepclassmembers</code></td>\n<td>仅成员</td>\n<td>仅成员</td>\n<td>仅成员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-keepclasseswithmembers</code></td>\n<td>是（条件匹配）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-keepclassmembernames</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>仅成员名</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;-keep class Foo&quot;] --&gt; B[类名 + 成员都保留]&#10;    C[&quot;-keepnames class Foo&quot;] --&gt; D[类名保留,可被压缩]&#10;    E[&quot;-keepclassmembers class Foo&quot;] --&gt; F[仅成员保留,类名可混淆]&#10;    G[&quot;-keepclasseswithmembers&quot;] --&gt; H[仅匹配条件的类保留]&#10;&#10;    classDef keepStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,C,E,G keepStyle\">graph TD\n    A[\"-keep class Foo\"] --&gt; B[类名 + 成员都保留]\n    C[\"-keepnames class Foo\"] --&gt; D[类名保留,可被压缩]\n    E[\"-keepclassmembers class Foo\"] --&gt; F[仅成员保留,类名可混淆]\n    G[\"-keepclasseswithmembers\"] --&gt; H[仅匹配条件的类保留]\n\n    classDef keepStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,C,E,G keepStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试混淆后的构建\">调试混淆后的构建</h2><p>混淆后的崩溃堆栈需要反混淆才能定位问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 保存 mapping 文件&#10;android {&#10;    buildTypes {&#10;        release {&#10;            isMinifyEnabled = true&#10;            proguardFiles(&#10;                getDefaultProguardFile(&quot;proguard-android-optimize.txt&quot;),&#10;                &quot;proguard-rules.pro&quot;&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// mapping 文件位置: app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 保存 mapping 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buildTypes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        release {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isMinifyEnabled = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            proguardFiles(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                getDefaultProguardFile(\"proguard-android-optimize.txt\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"proguard-rules.pro\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mapping 文件位置: app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>retrace</code> 工具反混淆：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 R8 retrace 工具&#10;java -jar retrace.jar mapping.txt stacktrace.txt&#10;&#10;# 或使用 Android SDK 提供的 proguard-retrace&#10;proguard-retrace.sh -regex &#39;%c.%m(%s:%l)&#39; mapping.txt stacktrace.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 R8 retrace 工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> retrace.jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mapping.txt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stacktrace.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或使用 Android SDK 提供的 proguard-retrace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">proguard-retrace.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -regex</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%c.%m(%s:%l)'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mapping.txt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stacktrace.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>调试技巧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>mapping.txt</code></td>\n<td>上传到 Play Console / Crashlytics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-printseeds</code></td>\n<td>输出被 keep 规则匹配的类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-printusage</code></td>\n<td>输出被移除的代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-printconfiguration</code></td>\n<td>输出最终合并的规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-whyareyoukeeping</code></td>\n<td>解释为什么某个类被保留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"proguard\" data-code=\"# 调试规则&#10;-printseeds seeds.txt&#10;-printusage unused.txt&#10;-printconfiguration full-config.txt&#10;-whyareyoukeeping class com.example.myapp.data.model.Article\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 调试规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-printseeds seeds.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-printusage unused.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-printconfiguration full-config.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-whyareyoukeeping class com.example.myapp.data.model.Article</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 始终将 <code>mapping.txt</code> 上传到 Google Play Console 和崩溃分析平台（如 Firebase Crashlytics），确保线上崩溃堆栈可以正确反混淆。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>R8 是 Android 默认的代码压缩和混淆工具，兼容 ProGuard 规则语法</li>\n<li>代码压缩移除未使用代码，混淆重命名为短名称，优化提升运行时性能</li>\n<li>Keep 规则防止关键代码被压缩或混淆，反射、序列化、API 接口等需要特别关注</li>\n<li><code>mapping.txt</code> 是反混淆崩溃堆栈的关键文件，必须妥善保存</li>\n<li>R8 Full Mode 提供更激进的优化，但需要更完善的 Keep 规则配置</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ProGuard 与 R8","id":"proguard-与-r8"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代码压缩（Shrinking）","id":"代码压缩-shrinking"},{"level":2,"text":"混淆（Obfuscation）","id":"混淆-obfuscation"},{"level":2,"text":"优化（Optimization）","id":"优化-optimization"},{"level":2,"text":"Keep 规则","id":"keep-规则"},{"level":2,"text":"调试混淆后的构建","id":"调试混淆后的构建"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"构建变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/build-variants"},"next":{"title":"Play Store 发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/play-store-release"}}